 every fish fight back as you control the drag, manage line tension, and read each run and dive to land your catch. Reel in over 50 species, from Largemouth bass and Rainbow trout to Muskellunge, Alligator gar, and sharks, each with its own model, habitat, and behavior.\n\nExplore six diverse waters, including Shadow Lake, the Everglades, the Florida Keys, and Lake Whitney, all with a full day-night cycle and shifting weather. Fish from shore, docks, or boat, and gear up with tackle from real brands like Mossy Oak, YETI, Abu Garcia, and Berkley. Compete in tournaments, climb the leaderboards, and chase your personal-best trophies.", "themes": [{"id": 32, "name": "Non-fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mlf-pro-catch", "videos": [{"id": 187912, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "9PjZuIl4WFo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9PjZuIl4WFo", "title": "MLF: Pro Catch | Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9PjZuIl4WFo/fhddefault.jpg"}]}